## 2. Vision & Problem Statement

### 2.1 Vision

> Every unorganized-sector worker in India deserves a verifiable record of their work, a transparent calculation of their wages, and a mechanism to contest unfair treatment. ShramikSetu builds the digital infrastructure for that record.

### 2.2 Problem Statement

India's unorganized workforce (~450M workers) operates in a documentation vacuum:

| Problem | Consequence |
|---|---|
| Verbal employment agreements | No enforceable record of wage, duration, or scope |
| Paper/WhatsApp attendance | Easily disputed, lost, or manipulated |
| Cash wages with no receipt | Wage theft is undetectable and unprovable |
| No employment history | Workers cannot prove experience for jobs, credit, or welfare |
| No compliance visibility | Labour inspectors cannot monitor thousands of small contractors |
| No dispute mechanism | Wage disagreements are absorbed silently by the worker |

### 2.3 Why Existing Solutions Are Insufficient

| Solution | What It Does | Gap ShramikSetu Fills |
|---|---|---|
| e-Shram Portal | One-time worker registration, UAN card | No per-project employment tracking, attendance, or wage records |
| BOCW Welfare Boards | Welfare schemes, cess collection | No day-to-day contractor-worker workflow digitization |
| WorkIndia / BetterPlace | Blue-collar job matching | Focus on hiring, not wage enforcement or compliance |
| State Labour Portals | Static information | No end-to-end employment lifecycle tracking |

**ShramikSetu's differentiator:** A single system unifying Contractor, Worker, Supervisor, and Inspector with automatic wage calculation, GPS-verified attendance, and built-in dispute resolution.

### 2.4 Explicit Scope Exclusions

The following are **not** in MVP and will not be added mid-project:

- Real payment gateway (UPI, NEFT, IMPS)
- Aadhaar or biometric authentication
- ML/AI models of any kind
- Blockchain or distributed ledger
- SMS gateway
- Native mobile application
- Continuous GPS tracking or route history
- AI-powered translation or voice features

