## 5. Product Goals & Success Metrics

### 5.1 Product Goals

| # | Goal | Category | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|
| G-1 | Digitize contractor-worker employment agreement via QR contract | Core | Must |
| G-2 | Eliminate manual wage calculation errors | Core | Must |
| G-3 | Create GPS-verified, PIN-based attendance records | Core | Must |
| G-4 | Generate portable employment history (Passport) per worker | Core | Must |
| G-5 | Provide inspectors with compliance monitoring dashboard | Governance | Must |
| G-6 | Enable structured dispute resolution with audit trail | Governance | Must |
| G-7 | Support 3 languages (EN/HI/MR) for worker accessibility | Accessibility | Must |
| G-8 | Record payment declarations in transparent ledger | Core | Must |

### 5.2 Success Metrics

| Metric | Definition | Target |
|---|---|---|
| End-to-end flow completion | % of contract→attendance→payment→passport flows completing without error | ≥ 95% |
| Attendance marking time | Time from PIN entry to confirmation | < 15 seconds |
| Contract acceptance time | Time from QR scan to contract accepted | < 60 seconds |
| Passport PDF generation | Time from request to download | < 5 seconds |
| Demo script coverage | % of 14 modules demonstrated | 100% |
| Critical bugs at demo | Open P0 bugs | 0 |
| Backend test coverage | Unit test coverage on API endpoints | ≥ 50% |
| Language coverage | % of UI strings translated in all 3 languages | ≥ 90% |

### 5.3 Non-Goals (Explicit)

| Non-Goal | Reason |
|---|---|
| Process real financial transactions | Requires PCI-DSS, business registration, KYC |
| Replace e-Shram registration | Different scope; complementary |
| Make legal compliance determinations | System surfaces data; humans decide |
| Achieve production-grade scalability | Academic MVP; demo-ready is sufficient |
| Support more than 3 languages | Scope constraint; architecture supports future additions |

