### 7.3 Key Architectural Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Frontend framework | Next.js 14 (App Router) | SSR for performance, file-based routing, Vercel deployment |
| State management | React Server Components + SWR for data fetching | Avoids Redux complexity; sufficient for this scale |
| i18n framework | next-intl | Native Next.js App Router support; static JSON files; no AI |
| Backend framework | FastAPI | Async, auto-docs (Swagger), Pydantic validation, Python ecosystem |
| Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL) | Free tier, built-in Auth, Storage, RLS, real-time subscriptions |
| Auth | Supabase Auth | Email+password, JWT, role metadata; no custom auth server |
| PDF generation | ReportLab | Python-native, no external service, reliable |
| QR generation | qrcode (Python) | Simple, well-maintained, generates PNG images |
| Charts | Chart.js | Lightweight, well-documented, no build complexity |
| Geolocation | Browser Geolocation API | No SDK needed; user grants permission on attendance |
| Distance calc | Haversine formula (backend) | Simple math; no external geocoding service |

