| GET | `/api/v1/wages/me` | Bearer | Worker | My wage records |
| GET | `/api/v1/wages/project/{id}` | Bearer | Contractor, Inspector | Wage records per project |
| GET | `/api/v1/wages/summary/{project_id}` | Bearer | Contractor | Payroll summary |
