### M-12: Audit Logs

**Purpose:** Maintain an immutable, append-only log of every significant action across all modules.

**Business Goal:** Provide complete accountability and a forensic trail for dispute resolution.

**Actors:** System (writes), Inspector/Admin (reads).

**Preconditions:** Any state-changing action occurs.

**User Story:**
> As an inspector, I want to see a complete log of who did what and when, so I can investigate disputes and verify compliance.

**Implementation:**

Cross-cutting utility function called from every service layer:

```python
async def write_audit_log(
    user_id: str,
    action: str,          # e.g., "contract.accepted"
    entity_type: str,     # e.g., "contract"
    entity_id: str,
    details: dict = None, # before/after values
    ip_address: str = None
):
    await db.execute(
        "INSERT INTO audit_logs (user_id, action, entity_type, entity_id, details, ip_address) VALUES (...)",
        ...
    )
```

**Logged Actions:**

| Module | Actions |
|---|---|
| Auth | `user.registered`, `user.login`, `user.password_reset` |
| Projects | `project.created`, `project.updated`, `project.cancelled` |
| Contracts | `contract.qr_generated`, `contract.accepted`, `contract.qr_regenerated` |
| Attendance | `attendance.pin_generated`, `attendance.marked`, `attendance.gps_blocked`, `attendance.overridden` |
| Payments | `payment.recorded` |
| Disputes | `dispute.raised`, `dispute.responded`, `dispute.resolved` |
| Passport | `passport.viewed`, `passport.exported` |
| Admin | `admin.user_role_changed` |

**Audit Log Data Model:**

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| audit_id | UUID (PK) |
| user_id | UUID (FK) |
| action | String(100) |
| entity_type | String(50) |
| entity_id | UUID |
| details | JSONB |
| ip_address | String(45) |
| created_at | Timestamp |

**Acceptance Criteria:**

- [ ] Every state-changing action writes to audit_logs
- [ ] Audit log is append-only (no UPDATE/DELETE permissions)
- [ ] Inspector filters by date, user, action, entity
- [ ] Details JSONB includes before/after state
- [ ] Audit log viewable only by Inspector and Admin
- [ ] Audit log included in dispute evidence view

**API Endpoints:**

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/v1/audit-logs` | Bearer | Inspector, Admin | Query with filters |
| GET | `/api/v1/audit-logs/entity/{type}/{id}` | Bearer | Inspector | Log for specific entity |

**Database Tables Used:** `audit_logs`

**UI Screens:**
