| R-7 | i18n coverage incomplete | Medium | Low | Prioritize worker-facing screens. Inspector can remain English. |
| R-8 | Browser GPS permission blocked on demo device | Medium | Medium | Test on actual demo device. Have manual lat/lng entry fallback. |
| R-9 | Database schema changes after Week 2 | Low | High | Schema locked Week 2. Changes require migration + team review. |
