## 21. Glossary

| Term | Definition |
|---|---|
| **Benefit Passport** | Auto-generated employment history document for a worker |
| **BOCW** | Building and Other Construction Workers (Act, 1996) |
| **e-Shram** | National database of unorganized workers (Ministry of Labour) |
| **Geofencing** | Virtual perimeter around a geographic location |
| **Haversine Formula** | Mathematical formula to calculate distance between two GPS coordinates |
| **i18n** | Internationalization – supporting multiple languages |
| **JWT** | JSON Web Token – authentication mechanism |
| **Payment Ledger** | Record of payment declarations (not a money transfer system) |
| **PIN** | Personal Identification Number – 6-digit attendance code |
| **QR Code** | Quick Response code – 2D barcode encoding a URL |
| **RBAC** | Role-Based Access Control |
| **RLS** | Row Level Security (PostgreSQL/Supabase) |
| **ShramikSetu** | "Bridge for Workers" – the product name |
| **UAN** | Unique Account Number (e-Shram) |
| **MVP** | Minimum Viable Product |
| **MoSCoW** | Must/Should/Could/Won't prioritization framework |

